            "title": "商米科技宣布未來10年發展戰略定位 初段股價逆市炒高破頂成「紅底股」",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">半新股商米科技(06810)自願公布對未來10年發展戰略定位，以「成為商業物理AI領導者」作願景；該股應聲炒高破頂，躋身「紅底股」行列。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17242670-%e5%95%86%e7%b1%b3%e7%a7%91%e6%8a%80%e5%ae%a3%e5%b8%83%e6%9c%aa%e4%be%8610%e5%b9%b4%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95%e6%88%b0%e7%95%a5%e5%ae%9a%e4%bd%8d-%e5%88%9d%e6%ae%b5%e8%82%a1%e5%83%b9%e9%80%86%e5%b8%82",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/06/20250626_FI_source-web_Sunmi-1.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 10:29:36",
